abstract: >-
  Reusable routing utilities, reusable code, compact audit evidence,
  and paired exact-reset evaluations for selecting between separately frozen
  Medium and Full world-model predictors. The release includes a prospectively
  sealed confirmation against a matched current-DINO/action control.
